# MNTN

> MNTN is an advertising technology company focused on making Connected TV a measurable growth channel for businesses.

MNTN combines the reach of television with the tracking and accountability of digital advertising. Brands and agencies can reach audiences on streaming TV and evaluate campaign performance alongside search, social, and their other marketing investments.

